object stability: same creation order repeats 1, two objects differ 1
object seed from the thread: one draw before new changes it 1
thread seeding: same order repeats 1, children differ 1
parent draw before the fork changes the child 1
a subtree seeded at its root repeats 1
creation order: earlier stream kept 1, inserted creation changes later 1
self-seeded objects: same seed repeats 1
